From 9449e139d2c7eb004c6fda8c01aa365d0efdb35a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patch-author <a@a.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 03:35:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0371: new Guild Titles system

- GameState.guildTitles/activeGuildTitle, exactly Hero.titles/activeTitle
  one level up. SAVE_VERSION 66 -> 67, migration adds empty defaults.
- New GuildTitleManager.ts (grant/display/setActive), direct one-level-up
  mirror of HeroManager's per-hero title functions.
- AchievementDef.grantsGuildTitle (empty-string sentinel, same convention
  as unlocksTrackId) granted through the same reportAchievements
  chokepoint that already grants bard tracks -- no new hook needed at
  any call site.
- Three titles granted for real: CHAIN_DRAGON_HUNT -> The Dragon
  Trackers, WORLDS_END -> Saviors of the Realm, LAST_GOD_DEFEATED -> The
  Godslayers. More addable purely via the devtool going forward.
- MenuWindow.tsx titlebar subtitle + Dashboard guild-name-card picker
  (plain <select>, mirroring HeroBlock.tsx's own hero title picker).
- tools/devtool/server.mjs: grantsGuildTitle added to the achievements
  schema.
- Verified: tsc --noEmit, vite build, electron-builder --linux dir
  package build, and an 11-check runtime script (via tsx) exercising
  grant/display/setActive/migration/achievement-data directly rather
  than just inferring correctness from types.
